## Duplicate xcodeproj-level Package.resolved
## The canonical Package.resolved lives at the xcworkspace level; xcodebuild
## regenerates a duplicate at the xcodeproj level that we don't want to track.
**/*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/Package.resolved

## Claude Code runtime artifacts
## Session-local lock file from the harness's scheduled-tasks feature and
## per-machine settings overrides. `.claude/skills/` stays tracked.
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/settings.local.json

## Playwright MCP runtime artifacts
## Console/page dumps the Playwright MCP server writes during browser runs.
.playwright-mcp/

## Analytics IDs (never committed; config.example.json is tracked)
fanny/fanny-macOS/Config/config.json
fanny/fanny-macOS/GoogleService-Info.plist

## Signing team (never committed; fanny/Xcode Config/Signing.xcconfig explains it)
fanny/Xcode Config/Local.xcconfig
